# 2026-08-12 起 docs/reviews/ 与 docs/research/ 的长期文档纳入 git——复盘、dogfood
# 日志、产品级计划和调研结论需要可追溯、可 diff、可在多机之间同步。检视循环的过程稿
# 仅在本地存活，闭环前完整归档进 RETROSPECTIVE.md，避免被 git add -A 意外提交。
docs/reviews/CURRENT-*.md
docs/reviews/FIX-log.md

# Probe raw output streams
server/scripts/codex-probe-*.jsonl

# Playwright E2E runtime artifacts (browsers themselves live outside the
# repo, in the OS-level Playwright cache — nothing binary to ignore there)
e2e/.tmp/
e2e/test-results/
e2e/playwright-report/
e2e/blob-report/

# ESLint incremental cache (npm run lint --cache); local-only, machine-specific
.eslintcache
